<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Bill type="bill" xmlns="http://leg.wa.gov/2012/document"><BillHeading><RequestNumber>Z-0662.2</RequestNumber><ShortBillId>SB 6156</ShortBillId><LongBillId>SENATE BILL 6156</LongBillId><Legislature>64th Legislature</Legislature><Session>2016 Regular Session</Session><Sponsors>Senators Rivers, Keiser, Frockt, Miloscia, Pedersen, Litzow, O'Ban, Sheldon, Rolfes, Conway, Mullet, Hasegawa, Benton, and Darneille; by request of Attorney General</Sponsors><BillHistory><PrefiledDate>Prefiled 12/17/15.</PrefiledDate><ReadDate>Read first time 01/11/16.</ReadDate><ReferredCommittee>Referred to Committee on Accountability &amp; Reform.</ReferredCommittee></BillHistory><BriefDescription>Reauthorizing the medicaid fraud false claims act.</BriefDescription></BillHeading>

<BillBody>
<BillTitle>AN ACT Relating to the medicaid fraud false claims act; and amending RCW 43.131.419 and 43.131.420.</BillTitle>
<EnactedClause />
<BillSection type="amendatory" action="amend">
<BillSectionHeader><BillSectionNumber><TextRun>Sec. </TextRun><Value>1</Value><TextRun>.  </TextRun></BillSectionNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>43</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>131</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>419</SectionNumber></SectionCite> and 2012 c 241 s 216 are each amended to read as follows:<Caption>Medicaid fraud false claims act<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Termination.</Caption></BillSectionHeader>
<P>The <TextRun amendingStyle="add">qui tam provisions of the</TextRun> medicaid fraud false claims act as established under chapter 74.66 RCW shall be terminated on June 30, <TextRun amendingStyle="strike">2016</TextRun> <TextRun amendingStyle="add">2023</TextRun>, as provided in RCW 43.131.420.</P>
<History>2012 c 241 § 216.</History>
<RCWNoteSection>
<AnnNote><NoteP><TextRun fontWeight="bold">Intent<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Finding<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>2012 c 241:</TextRun> See note following RCW 74.66.010.</NoteP></AnnNote>
</RCWNoteSection>
</BillSection>
<BillSection type="amendatory" action="amend">
<BillSectionHeader><BillSectionNumber><TextRun>Sec. </TextRun><Value>2</Value><TextRun>.  </TextRun></BillSectionNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>43</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>131</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>420</SectionNumber></SectionCite> and 2012 c 241 s 217 are each amended to read as follows:<Caption>Medicaid fraud false claims act<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Repeal.</Caption></BillSectionHeader>
<P>The following acts or parts of acts, as now existing or hereafter amended, are each repealed, effective June 30, <TextRun amendingStyle="strike">2017</TextRun> <TextRun amendingStyle="add">2024</TextRun>:</P>
<P>(1) <TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarkleft">RCW 74.66.010 and 2012 c 241 s 201;</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarknone">(2) RCW 74.66.020 and 2012 c 241 s 202;</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarknone">(3) RCW 74.66.030 and 2012 c 241 s 203;</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarknone">(4) RCW 74.66.040 and 2012 c 241 s 204;</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarkright">(5)</TextRun> RCW 74.66.050 and 2012 c 241 s 205;</P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strike">(6)</TextRun> <TextRun amendingStyle="add">(2)</TextRun> RCW 74.66.060 and 2012 c 241 s 206;</P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strike">(7)</TextRun> <TextRun amendingStyle="add">(3)</TextRun> RCW 74.66.070 and 2012 c 241 s 207;</P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strike">(8)</TextRun> <TextRun amendingStyle="add">(4)</TextRun> RCW 74.66.080 and 2012 c 241 s 208; <TextRun amendingStyle="add">and</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarkleft">(9) RCW 74.66.090 and 2012 c 241 s 209;</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarknone">(10) RCW 74.66.100 and 2012 c 241 s 210;</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarknone">(11) RCW 74.66.110 and 2012 c 241 s 211;</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarknone">(12) RCW 74.66.120 and 2012 c 241 s 212;</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarkright">(13)</TextRun> <TextRun amendingStyle="add">(5)</TextRun> RCW 74.66.130 and 2012 c 241 s 213<TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarkleft">; and</TextRun></P>
<P><TextRun amendingStyle="strikemarkright">(14) RCW 74.66.005 and 2012 c 241 s 214</TextRun>.</P>
<History>2012 c 241 § 217.</History>
<RCWNoteSection>
<AnnNote><NoteP><TextRun fontWeight="bold">Intent<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Finding<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>2012 c 241:</TextRun> See note following RCW 74.66.010.</NoteP></AnnNote>
</RCWNoteSection>
</BillSection>
</BillBody>
